Add GenericSetup profiles ``default`` and ``uninstall`` and the browser layer ``IPloneAppContentrulesLayer``.
The rule storage, the "Content Rules" control panel, the "Rules" tab and the "Content rules: Manage rules" permission settings are now set up by this package instead of ``Products.CMFPlone``.
Management views are only available when the add-on is activated.
See PLIP https://github.com/plone/Products.CMFPlone/issues/4119.
